{"results":[{"url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/fact-checker/wp/2015/11/23/bernie-sanderss-claim-that-he-would-expand-not-dismantle-the-affordable-care-act/","final_url":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/fact-checker/wp/2015/11/23/bernie-sanderss-claim-that-he-would-expand-not-dismantle-the-affordable-care-act/","title":"Bernie Sanders’s claim that he would expand, not dismantle, the Affordable Care Act","description":"Sanders employs political worthsmithing to describe his health care proposal.","language":"en","text":"Democracy Dies in Darkness\n\nBy  Michelle Ye Hee Lee\n\n*“This is just old-fashioned political gimmickry. I helped write the Affordable Care Act. So I don’t want somebody suggesting I’m trying to dismantle legislation that I helped write.”*\n\n**— Sen. Bernie Sanders (I-Vt.), interview with Des Moines Register,** **Nov. 16, 2015**\n\n---","author":"Michelle Ye Hee Lee","published_date":"2015-11-23T15:56:51.000Z","latency_ms":871.2405280093662,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}